                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b97d6e77-2818-3b29-bedc-8305048fedab",
                        "entry_id": "207d8e1b-5cc1-369d-9013-23e09ffcdf22",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Solemnly or ponderously sad."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "900e457b-d364-45c9-8cf1-9fa8c9316b5e",
                                "sense_id": "b97d6e77-2818-3b29-bedc-8305048fedab",
                                "text": "Through dolorous despaire, which she conceyved,\nInto the Sea her selfe did headlong throw,\nThinking to have her griefe by death bereaved."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a56dcd27-fdaa-42f7-9498-bd24e8adde80",
                                "sense_id": "b97d6e77-2818-3b29-bedc-8305048fedab",
                                "text": ". . . Hell itself will pass away,\nAnd leave her dolorous mansions to the peering day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d4e61df-d320-4d45-a7ae-d1cb7f5109ed",
                                "sense_id": "b97d6e77-2818-3b29-bedc-8305048fedab",
                                "text": "From this prison here of horror, whence I every hour tend nearer and nearer to destruction, I send you . . . the assurance of my dolorous and unhappy service."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "405a4102-40e7-4b47-bbc4-e1fcd9b1709c",
                                "sense_id": "b97d6e77-2818-3b29-bedc-8305048fedab",
                                "text": "She turned and waved a hand to him, she cried a word, but he didn't hear it, it was a lost word. A sable wraith she was in the parkland, fading away into the dolorous crypt of winter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a625a7c5-ac0d-4a56-948f-e71f8207e960",
                                "sense_id": "b97d6e77-2818-3b29-bedc-8305048fedab",
                                "text": "The dolorous effects of the second world war on train services, and its protracted legacies of over-age equipment and shortages of material for replacement, are too fresh in memory to require recapitulation here; […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90467533-22e4-4b8e-bdc7-630e438708ac",
                                "sense_id": "b97d6e77-2818-3b29-bedc-8305048fedab",
                                "text": "As World War II came to a close, the gaunt and dolorous child was liberated at yet another death camp, Buchenwald."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
